## avx2 suppressions
# This is tracked at https://github.com/open-quantum-safe/liboqs/issues/2609
# For independent uniform draws, the rejection count is independent of the
# accepted positions. The stream is seeded with a secret, so classification
# depends on the computational security model.

{
   Rejection sampling from the key generation stream
   Memcheck:Cond
   src:rsd.c:61 # fun:oqs_sig_private_sdith_avx2_rsd_generate_random_instance_ref
   fun:oqs_sig_private_sdith_avx2_sdith_keygen
   fun:oqs_sig_pubapi_sdith_*_crypto_sign_keypair
   fun:OQS_SIG_sdith_*_keypair
   fun:OQS_SIG_keypair
}

